{"resourceIdentifier":"2831","resourceName":"SHANDONG LIJIN BREEDING SWINE FARM BIOGAS RECOVERY PROJECT","description":"Shandong Lijin Breeding Swine Farm Biogas RecoveryProject(hereinafter referred to as the Project) locates inLijin Huayu Breeding Swine Farm, Kongjiazao Village, Mingji Township, Lijin County, Dongying City, Shandong Province, P.R China. The project is owned and implementedby LijinHuayuBreeding SwineCo., Ltd.\r\nThe project is tointroduces anew anaerobic animal manure management system to treat manure waste (Breeding swine) from Lijin Huayu Breeding Swine Farm. This project uses USR(Up-flow Solid Reactor) to treat animal manure, and collect and destroy the generated biogas to avoid methane emissions.The generatedbiogas will be captured and sent to flaring withinthe project site. The residual waste from the USRdigesters will be sent outside of the project site for aerobic composting and then returned to the field as fertilizer.\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, the swinemanure waste was left to decay in anaerobic manure management system at the LijinHuayu Breeding Swine Farmand generated methane is emitted to the atmosphere directly without any methane recovery and destruction facility.\r\nThe project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas. The project is expected to achieve an annual emission reduction of 17,727tCO2e and a total emission reduction of 124,089tCO2e during the first 7-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":37.603300,"longitude":118.162836},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-02-23","endExclusive":"2022-03-26","endInclusive":"2022-03-25"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2831"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Lijin Huayu Breeding Swine Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 21 23019950"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"17727"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"20/02/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/06/2022 - 31/05/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59281&IDKEY=f903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfr81748499","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-12-27T07:29:37.133Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59706&IDKEY=jkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909k82334574","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Lijin Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-01-06T04:42:46.973Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=85032&IDKEY=llksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098o117259128","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS2831-Project-Description-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-20T14:52:05.52Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=66730&IDKEY=f8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0u92020670","documentType":"Registrat